Hasho Stories Privacy Policy
Updated: October 14, 2026

This policy applies to Hasho Stories / Hasho Storytelling published by Yusha (iOS bundle com.yusha.storytelling and Android package ai.hasho.storytelling).

No data collection or sharing
This release does not collect or send personal information, account details, purchase records or app usage to Yusha or third-party services. It has no account registration, sign-in, cloud account connection, purchase or receipt verification, advertising SDK, analytics SDK, advertising identifier collection or cross-app tracking. It does not use Google Analytics or Firebase Analytics. It does not provide nearby-device data transfer or cloud AI processing.

Local stories and learning
Drawings, imported character images, saved adventures, built characters, language preferences, friend personalization, local learning progress and conversation reports stay in the app's private storage on your device. These records let you continue activities and review local progress. Character joint detection, drawing recognition, reconstruction and conversation models run on-device.

Microphone and images
Microphone permission supports reading practice and character conversations using on-device speech recognition and bundled local models. The release app does not upload microphone input or persist microphone audio recordings. Recognized text may appear in local learning and conversation reports. Camera and photo access, when used, support your requested image import; imported images are processed locally. No email address or account is needed for these activities. The app does not request contacts, location or advertising identifiers.

Storage and deletion
Saved adventures can be deleted through the app. Local records stay in private app storage until deleted or the app is removed. Any operating-system backup is controlled by your device's backup settings; Yusha does not operate an app-data backup server. App distribution and installation are handled by Apple or Google under their own store policies. There are no in-app purchases in this release.

Children and contact
The app's activities use local device data only. A parent or guardian can contact Yusha at yusha@yusha.ai with privacy questions. Sending an email is optional and separate from the app; we use a received email only to answer the request.
